B = [
('Mercedes-Benz','Europe','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Mercedes-Benz, upright, dignified and solid formal engineering from the late analogue era. Forms are tall, squared and flat-sided with sharp creases, generous glazing on thin supports, and chunky edges with black rubber strips. A bright three-pointed star in a ring is the single recurring mark, set against wide polished surrounds and thin vertical ribbing. Palette is champagne, ivory, signal red, midnight blue, silver grey and black, with bright chrome catching light. Interiors use tan or blue leather and tufted velour, warm walnut veneer, big round dials and large rotary knobs. Lettering is plain, even, upright capitals. Advertising is calm, dark and elegant, with spotlit silver surfaces and understated confidence.'),
('Toyota','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Toyota, sensible, dependable mass-market design with a crisp modern edge. Shapes are angular and clean, with sharp shoulder creases, slab sides, sculpted upper surfaces and wide hourglass or trapezoid openings in glossy black. Thin swept lamp shapes with hooked inner lines and compact C-shaped lights add a sporty bite. Large black plastic trim around edges gives a tougher, practical feel. Materials are tidy grey fabric, soft-touch plastic and piano-black panels. Palette is super white, deep black, cool silver, signal red and bright blue. The identity is a simple three-oval emblem in red or chrome, with plain wide sans-serif lettering. Photography is bright, optimistic, outdoor and everyday, in white-and-red graphic layouts.'),
('Tesla','North America','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Tesla, minimalist, clean and futuristic, with a software-first calm. Surfaces are smooth and unbroken, closed-off and flush, with low sloping lines, slim light bands, large glass planes and almost no chrome or visible fasteners. A sleek T-shaped emblem in brushed silver sits alone on dark matte fields. Palette is pearl white, solid black, graphite, midnight silver and one strong red, in sharp, high-contrast layouts. Materials are matte black, brushed metal, white vegan-leather-like upholstery and pale wood strips with nearly no buttons. Lettering is wide, geometric, widely spaced capitals, often with a squared techno feel. Photography is dark, glossy, studio-lit and cinematic, with spotlit edges and empty negative space.'),
('Louis Vuitton','Europe','19th century-present','luxury goods','In the style of Louis Vuitton, heritage travel luxury built on repeating pattern. Coated brown surfaces carry a monogram of interlocking L and V letters alternating with four-petal flowers and diamonds in tan gold, or a checkerboard of dark and pale squares in brown, grey and bright colourways. Edges are bound in natural leather that ages to honey, with polished brass studs, clasps, locks and rolled handles, and mustard stitching. Packaging is warm saffron orange boxes with brown trim and navy ribbon. Lettering is wide-spaced, thin, upright capitals in white or gold on black or cream. Playful bright reinterpretations sit beside classic ones. Campaign photography is dark, spotlit, glossy and cinematic with rich, aged warmth.'),
('Gucci','Europe','1960s-present','luxury goods','In the style of Gucci, bold, sumptuous, eclectic luxury. A green and red stripe band runs over beige and brown fields, with an interlocking double G monogram in repeating pattern, curved lacquered bamboo shapes and a gold horsebit bar detail. Vivid vintage floral prints with butterflies, blooms, bees, tigers and snakes appear in dense, colourful, storybook layouts. Maximalist phases add embroidery, velvet, jewel tones, clashing colour, quirky retro mixes and ornate gilt metal. Packaging is deep burgundy red or moss green with matte tonal pattern, wide-spaced thin capital lettering and ribbon. Photography is rich, theatrical and slightly surreal, with saturated colour, vintage interiors and playful, collectable charm.'),
]
